{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_VALIST_AS_PTR__"}}----
Intrinsic define (macro value) set by the compiler

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	""__FB_VALIST_AS_PTR__""
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Returns non-zero (-1) when ##-z valist-as-ptr## represents variadic argument lists with pointer expressions where supported, or zero (0) otherwise.

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.4

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- [[CompilerOptz|Compiler Option: -z]]
	- ##[[KeyPgCvaList|cva_list]]##

